@* Replaces Profile.ascx + Profile.ascx.cs + Profile.ascx.designer.cs.

   NOTE ON THE TYPE NAME: the Razor compiler names the component after the file, so the class is now
   DesktopModules.Admin.Security.Profile where it used to be DesktopModules.Admin.Security.DNNProfile
   (the .ascx was already named Profile.ascx, and the code-behind only carried the DNN prefix).
   ViewProfile, Login, EditUser and ManageUsers declare a `ctlProfile` field of that type and must
   refer to `Profile` once they are converted.

   The inline <script> block is gone - a .razor file cannot carry one. Its body (dnnSettingDropdown
   on the setting dropdowns, dnnPanels on the editor's container, and the randomised `autocomplete`
   attribute on the Country/Region inputs that stops the browser autofilling them) moved verbatim
   into wwwroot/desktopmodules/Admin/Security/Scripts/dnn.Profile.js as dnn.setUpProfile(), which is
   registered as a client resource and invoked through IJSRuntime from OnAfterRenderAsync. The
   original re-ran the same function from PageRequestManager.add_endRequest after every partial
   postback; OnAfterRenderAsync runs after every render, which is the Blazor equivalent of that.

   <dnn:ProfileEditorControl> keeps all of its original configuration (GroupByMode="Section",
   enableClientValidation="true"); ViewStateMode="Disabled" is moot because there is no view state.
   Its User / ShowVisibility / DataSource / EditMode / LabelMode / LocalResourceFile values are
   passed as parameters bound to the fields the code-behind used to assign, so the per-property
   visibility rules still decide what is handed to the editor.

   <ul id="actionsRow" runat="server"> was shown/hidden through the ShowUpdate property; the element
   is now rendered conditionally on the same flag. *@

@namespace DesktopModules.Admin.Security
@inherits DotNetNuke.Entities.Modules.ProfileUserControlBase

@using DotNetNuke.Entities.Profile
@using DotNetNuke.UI.WebControls

<div class="dnnForm dnnProfile dnnClear">
    <ProfileEditorControl @ref="this.ProfileProperties"
                          GroupByMode="GroupByMode.Section"
                          EnableClientValidation="true"
                          EditMode="@this.editorMode"
                          LabelMode="@this.labelMode"
                          LocalResourceFile="@this.LocalResourceFile"
                          User="@this.User"
                          ShowVisibility="@this.ShowVisibility"
                          DataSource="@this.profileDataSource" />
    <div class="dnnClear"></div>
    @if (this.showUpdate)
    {
        <ul id="actionsRow" class="dnnActions dnnClear">
            <li><a class="dnnPrimaryAction" href="javascript:void(0);" @onclick="this.CmdUpdateClick" @onclick:preventDefault="true">@this.LocalizeText("cmdUpdate.Text")</a></li>
        </ul>
    }
</div>
